Code and tables adapted from RuneLite
-------------------------------------

Portions of the following classes are derived from or ported from RuneLite
(https://github.com/runelite/runelite):

- HealthRecovery.java and CombatVitalsPlugin.java: health-bar ratio inversion,
  single-opponent tracking, player Hitpoints hiscores lookup, and boss HP HUD
  suppression (hasHpHud) from OpponentInfoPlugin and OpponentInfoOverlay.
- BoostTimer.java: Preserve stat-drain cycle calculation ported from
  BoostsPlugin#getChangeDownTicks.
- EssencePouch.java: degraded essence pouch capacity table ported from
  EssencePouchOverlay.
- SidePillars.java and PillarPainter.java: side-panel viewport offsets, bar
  dimensions, and BarRenderer background, inset, and label-baseline constants
  from StatusBarsOverlay and BarRenderer.
- AlertSounds.java: volume-to-decibel gain conversion from Notifier.
- SkillingEvents.java: Forestry object and NPC spawn IDs, pet chat lines, and
  random-event NPC IDs and cooldown read from WoodcuttingPlugin,
  ScreenshotPlugin, and RandomEventPlugin.
- src/test/resources/logback-test.xml: test logger configuration from
  RuneLite's example-plugin template.

