Independent re-implementations (inspired by, no code copied)
------------------------------------------------------------

Features overlapping with the following plugins were implemented from scratch
for Combat & Skilling Vitals without copying their source code:

- NPC Health Text (devrat0, BSD 2-Clause) and Monster HP Percentage
  (Le Jeffe, https://github.com/lejeffe/MonsterHP, BSD 2-Clause): inspired
  overhead health text placement and monster HP / percentage display rules.
- NPC Aggression Timer (RuneLite built-in, BSD 2-Clause): inspired the
  10-minute aggression countdown and optional 21x21 area lines.
- Inventory Notifier (dandylyon), Fish Barrel (molo-pl,
  https://github.com/molo-pl/runelite-plugins), Idle Alarm (observnad,
  https://github.com/observnad/Idle-Alarm), Clue Scroll Notifier (SoaresPT,
  https://github.com/SoaresPT/clue-scroll-notifier), and Sound Alerts
  Expanded: inspired the combined inventory-full alerts, container rows,
  gentle repeating alerts, clue-tier skilling notifications, and custom
  per-alert WAV folder.
- Shortest Path (Skretzo, https://github.com/Skretzo/shortest-path,
  BSD 2-Clause): optional next-fishing-spot routing communicates solely over
  RuneLite's public PluginMessage event bus; no Shortest Path code is bundled.
